# Kamal secrets — copy to .kamal/secrets (already gitignored)
#
# Registry password:
#   morafeq-on-rails is public, so ghcr.io images are public too.
#   The password is only needed to push — the VM pulls without auth.
#   Create a PAT at https://github.com/settings/tokens with write:packages scope
#
# Pick ONE pattern below:

# ── Pattern A: pass (recommended) ──
# Install: sudo apt install pass && pass init "your@email.com"
# Store:   pass insert github/morafeq-pat
# KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$(pass github/morafeq-pat)
# RAILS_MASTER_KEY=$(cat config/master.key)

# ── Pattern B: env var ──
# Export before deploy: export KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=ghp_xxx
# KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD
# RAILS_MASTER_KEY=$(cat config/master.key)

# ── Pattern C: direct (simplest, personal machine) ──
# KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# RAILS_MASTER_KEY=$(cat config/master.key)
